// What this engine alone decides about an OpenArm v1. Its limbs and joints
// come from the robot's description, through sim_robot_core's entry of the
// same name, and its MuJoCo model, servo gains and weight compensation from
// the release of Waldo's catalogue the base image bakes.
{
  // The model ships no light, so rendering adds the engine's light rig.
  camera_lights: true,
}
